1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,203
Make the body denser, and it sinks lower.

2
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:05,325
Lighter, and it rides higher.

3
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:13,867
Ice in sea water has a density ratio of about zero point eight nine, so almost nine tenths of an iceberg hides below the surface.

